Manage Confluent Cloud IAM identity providers.

Usage:
  confluent iam identity-provider [command]

Aliases:
  identity-provider, provider

Available Commands:
  create      Create an IAM identity provider.
  delete      Delete one or more IAM identity providers.
  describe    Describe an IAM identity provider.
  list        List IAM identity providers.
  update      Update an existing IAM identity provider.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent iam identity-provider [command] --help" for more information about a command.
